// Prompt: "A member borrows a book; if returned late, a fine applies."
// Nouns -> classes; verbs -> methods; adjectives -> fields.
class Member {                 // noun -> class
    private String name;       // attribute
    void borrow(Book book) { } // verb -> method on the actor
}
class Book {                   // noun -> class
    private String title;      // attribute
    private boolean available; // adjective -> field
}
class Fine {                   // noun -> class (has data + behaviour)
    private BigDecimal amount;
    BigDecimal calculate(long overdueDays) { return amount.multiply(BigDecimal.valueOf(overdueDays)); }
}
```
*Keep only nouns that have state and behaviour; "late" is a condition, not a class.*

